Description: @SUBTITLE@
 @NAME@ is a cross-platform management console for XCP-ng, written in Rust
 and egui and derived from XCP-ng Center / XenAdmin 25.04: connect to
 XCP-ng hosts, manage VMs, storage, networks and pools, and open VM
 consoles. An independent community project, not an official XCP-ng, Vates
 or Citrix product.
